ext{d}r" 13194139535230 true] [17592186338895 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535230 true] [17592186338895 1111 #uuid "88d55be4-a97e-5881-8bfc-c7090e4fc5a7" 13194139535230 true] [17592186338896 1017 #edb/ref 17592186338897 13194139535230 true] [17592186338896 1089 "q-77180" 13194139535230 true] [17592186338896 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535230 true] [17592186338896 1100 "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14060128/assets/93c6184f39b28a057866bb02e11e5e81a7abea4ff8a9a907670dd30cfc93d557.png)\n\nThe path ${C}_{1}$ consists of a line segment from the point $A(1,-1)$ to the point $B(1,1),$ and the path ${C}_{2}$ consists of a line segment from the point $B(1,1)$ to the point $O(0,0).$\n\nGiven that ${\\int }_{{C}_{1}}F\\cdot \\text{d}r=2,$ evaluate ${\\int }_{C}F\\cdot \\text{d}r,$ where $F(x,y)=(2x+y)\\,i+(x-2y)\\,j,$ and $C={C}_{1}\\cup {C}_{2}.$" 13194139535230 true] [17592186338896 1113 #uuid "6b23e654-4079-5b0e-97ef-807a9ce88efc" 13194139535230 true] [17592186338896 1145 "We will use the fact that\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{C}F\\cdot \\text{d}r={\\int }_{{C}_{1}}F\\cdot \\text{d}r+{\\int }_{{C}_{2}}F\\cdot \\text{d}r.\n$$\n\nWe're given the value of the first integral, so we only need to work out the second.\n\nThe path ${C}_{2}$ is the line segment from $B$ to $O.$ It can be parametrized as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}_{2}(t) & =b+t(0-b) \\\\  & =⟨1,1⟩+t(⟨0,0⟩-⟨1,1⟩) \\\\  & =⟨1-t,1-t⟩ \\\\  & =(1-t)\\,i+(1-t)\\,j,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $0<t<1.$ Along this segment, we have $x=1-t$ and $y=1-t.$ Therefore, \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F({r}_{2}(t)) & =(2x+y)\\,i+(x-2y)\\,j \\\\  & =(2(1-t)+(1-t))\\,i+((1-t)-2(1-t))\\,j \\\\  & =(3-3t)\\,i+(-1+t)\\,j.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nComputing the derivative, we get the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}_{2}^{′}(t) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(1-t)i+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(1-t)j \\\\  & =-i-j\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can now compute the dot product:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F({r}_{2}(t))\\cdot {r}_{2}^{′}(t) & =((3-3t)\\,i+(-1+t)\\,j)\\cdot (-i-j) \\\\  & =-3+3t+1-t \\\\  & =-2+2t\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we can evaluate the integral, as follows: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{C}F\\cdot \\text{d}r & ={\\int }_{{C}_{1}}F\\cdot \\text{d}r+{\\int }_{{C}_{2}}F\\cdot \\text{d}r \\\\  & =2+{\\int }_{0}^{1}F({r}_{2}(t))\\cdot {r}_{2}^{′}(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =2+{\\int }_{0}^{1}(-2+2t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =2+(-2t+{t}^{2})\\,{|}_{0}^{1} \\\\  & =2+(1-2) \\\\  & =1\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535230 true] [17592186338897 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338898 13194139535230 true] [17592186338897 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338899 13194139535230 true] [17592186338897 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338900 13194139535230 true] [17592186338897 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338901 13194139535230 true] [17592186338897 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338902 13194139535230 true] [17592186338897 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535230 true] [17592186338897 1041 "selection" 13194139535230 true] [17592186338897 1104 #edb/ref 17592186338899 13194139535230 true] [17592186338897 1110 #uuid "cea72292-bb3b-5849-8e31-284ababca1a8" 13194139535230 true] [17592186338898 1034 "3" 13194139535230 true] [17592186338898 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535230 true] [17592186338898 1111 #uuid "c2ef356c-189b-5e99-a808-46697b531d81" 13194139535230 true] [17592186338899 1034 "1" 13194139535230 true] [17592186338899 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535230 true] [17592186338899 1111 #uuid "5dd041e4-5c46-5b1b-932b-b7a7a12d0e0b" 13194139535230 true] [17592186338900 1034 "-4" 13194139535230 true] [17592186338900 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535230 true] [17592186338900 1111 #uuid "20553f41-4af2-5f54-b6a1-5a66c62ca370" 13194139535230 true] [17592186338901 1034 "-1" 13194139535230 true] [17592186338901 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535230 true] [17592186338901 1111 #uuid "278d4085-7e0a-578c-9e8a-148389aef44b" 13194139535230 true] [17592186338902 1034 "5" 13194139535230 true] [17592186338902 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535230 true] [17592186338902 1111 #uuid "34b747f3-40dc-55c1-b06f-5e2b43226b93" 13194139535230 true] [17592186338903 1017 #edb/ref 17592186338904 13194139535230 true] [17592186338903 1089 "q-77191" 13194139535230 true] [17592186338903 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535230 true] [17592186338903 1100 "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14060128/assets/0457cb819e6f39ef9c0978e356cff788e1cf5edbef9cbf844a054ab777b70eac.png)\n\nThe path ${C}_{1}$ consists of a the line segment from the point $A(-2,0)$ to the point $B(0,1),$ and the path ${C}_{2}$ consists of the line segment from the point $B(0,1)$ to the point $D(1,1).$\n\nGiven that ${\\int }_{{C}_{2}}F\\cdot \\text{d}r=-\\frac{3}{2},$ evaluate ${\\int }_{C}F\\cdot \\text{d}r,$ where $F(x,y)=(x-2y)\\,i+(y-x)\\,j,$ and $C={C}_{1}\\cup {C}_{2}.$" 13194139535230 true] [17592186338903 1113 #uuid "0ab1f56f-02fc-5f46-858a-7849e0bd1d9b" 13194139535230 true] [17592186338903 1145 "We will use the fact that\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{C}F\\cdot \\text{d}r={\\int }_{{C}_{1}}F\\cdot \\text{d}r+{\\int }_{{C}_{2}}F\\cdot \\text{d}r.\n$$\n\nWe're given the value of the second integral, so we only need to work out the first.\n\nThe path ${C}_{1}$ is the line segment from $A$ to $B.$  It can be parametrized as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}_{1}(t) & =a+t(b-a) \\\\  & =⟨-2,0⟩+t(⟨0,1⟩-⟨-2,0⟩) \\\\  & =⟨-2+2t,t⟩ \\\\  & =(-2+2t)i+t\\,j,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $0<t<1.$ Along this segment, we have $x=-2+2t$ and $y=t.$ Therefore, \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F({r}_{1}(t)) & =(x-2y)\\,i+(y-x)\\,j \\\\  & =((-2+2t)-2t)\\,i+(t-(-2+2t))\\,j \\\\  & =-2\\,i+(2-t)\\,j.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nComputing the derivative, we get the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}_{1}^{′}(t) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(-2+2t)i+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(t)j \\\\  & =2\\,i+j\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can now compute the dot product:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F({r}_{1}(t))\\cdot {r}_{1}^{′}(t) & =(-2\\,i+(2-t)\\,j)\\cdot (2\\,i+j) \\\\  & =-2-t\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we can evaluate the integral, as follows: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{C}F\\cdot \\text{d}r & ={\\int }_{{C}_{1}}F\\cdot \\text{d}r+{\\int }_{{C}_{2}}F\\cdot \\text{d}r \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}F({r}_{1}(t))\\cdot {r}_{1}^{′}(t)\\,\\text{d}t+(-\\frac{3}{2}) \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}(-2-t)\\,\\text{d}t-\\frac{3}{2} \\\\  & ={[-2t-\\frac{{t}^{2}}{2}]}_{0}^{1}-\\frac{3}{2} \\\\  & =[-2(1)-\\frac{{1}^{2}}{2}-0]-\\frac{3}{2} \\\\  & =-\\frac{5}{2}-\\frac{3}{2} \\\\  & =-4\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535230 true] [17592186338904 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338905 13194139535230 true] [17592186338904 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338906 13194139535230 true] [17592186338904 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338907 13194139535230 true] [17592186338904 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338908 13194139535230 true] [17592186338904 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338909 13194139535230 true] [17592186338904 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535230 true] [17592186338904 1041 "selection" 13194139535230 true] [17592186338904 1104 #edb/ref 17592186338906 13194139535230 true] [17592186338904 1110 #uuid "e04d1706-e4ee-5f20-88dc-73e0f5bd2ff4" 13194139535230 true] [17592186338905 1034 "-\\frac{3}{2}" 13194139535230 true] [17592186338905 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535230 true] [17592186338905 1111 #uuid "d6c1ba85-ee74-5e78-944b-e912801c796e" 13194139535230 true] [17592186338906 1034 "-4" 13194139535230 true] [17592186338906 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535230 true] [17592186338906 1111 #uuid "e710d8cb-1dd7-549c-9e98-ee9fff60fdce" 13194139535230 true] [17592186338907 1034 "4" 13194139535230 true] [17592186338907 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535230 true] [17592186338907 1111 #uuid "e2d034c2-6ca0-5097-a3ec-1886658f2040" 13194139535230 true] [17592186338908 1034 "\\frac{3}{2}" 13194139535230 true] [17592186338908 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535230 true] [17592186338908 1